## Article 283. Tax and customs cases

```catala
declaration scope Article283TaxCustomsCases:
  input check content TaxCustomsCaseCheck
  output challengeAllowed content YesNo
  output filingWithinDeadline content YesNo
  output appealWithinDeadline content YesNo
  output cassationWithinDeadline content YesNo

scope Article283TaxCustomsCases:
# Tax and customs decisions can be challenged
  label challenge_individual definition challengeAllowed under condition
    check.actIndividual = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label challenge_normative definition challengeAllowed under condition
    check.actNormative = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_challenge definition challengeAllowed equals No

# Filing within 30 days of notification
  label timely_filing definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    check.filedWithinThirtyDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely_filing definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    check.filedWithinThirtyDays = No
    consequence equals No

# Appeal within 5 days
  label timely_appeal definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    check.appealFiledWithinFiveDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely_appeal definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    check.appealFiledWithinFiveDays = No
    consequence equals No

# Cassation within 10 days
  label timely_cassation definition cassationWithinDeadline under condition
    check.cassationFiledWithinTenDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely_cassation definition cassationWithinDeadline under condition
    check.cassationFiledWithinTenDays = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 283-1. Sanctions cases

```catala
declaration scope Article2831SanctionsCases:
  input check content SanctionsCaseCheck
  output sanctionsChallengeAllowed content YesNo
  output filingWithinDeadline content YesNo
  output appealWithinDeadline content YesNo
  output cassationWithinDeadline content YesNo
  output courtMayCancelSanctions content YesNo

scope Article2831SanctionsCases:
# Sanctions can be challenged by affected person
  label challenge_allowed definition sanctionsChallengeAllowed under condition
    check.filedByAffectedPerson = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_challenge definition sanctionsChallengeAllowed equals No

# Filing within 60 days
  label timely_filing definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    check.filedWithinSixtyDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely_filing definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    check.filedWithinSixtyDays = No
    consequence equals No

# Appeal within 5 days
  label timely_appeal definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    check.appealFiledWithinFiveDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely_appeal definition appealWithinDeadline under condition
    check.appealFiledWithinFiveDays = No
    consequence equals No

# Cassation within 10 days
  label timely_cassation definition cassationWithinDeadline under condition
    check.cassationFiledWithinTenDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely_cassation definition cassationWithinDeadline under condition
    check.cassationFiledWithinTenDays = No
    consequence equals No

# Only court may cancel sanctions
  label court_cancel definition courtMayCancelSanctions under condition
    check.onlyCourtMayCancelSanctions = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_cancel definition courtMayCancelSanctions equals No
```

## Article 283-2. Mobilization driving restriction cases

```catala
declaration scope Article2832MobilizationDriving:
  input check content MobilizationDrivingCheck
  output challengeAllowed content YesNo
  output filingWithinDeadline content YesNo

scope Article2832MobilizationDriving:
# Driving restrictions during mobilization can be challenged
  label challenge definition challengeAllowed under condition
    check.drivingRestrictedDuringMobilization = Yes
    and check.restrictionUnlawful = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_challenge definition challengeAllowed equals No

# Filing within 30 days
  label timely definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    check.filedWithinThirtyDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label untimely definition filingWithinDeadline under condition
    check.filedWithinThirtyDays = No
    consequence equals No
```
